# Fieldnotes — Environment Variables
# Copy this file to .env and fill in real values.
# Never commit .env to version control.

# ─── Cloudflare Web Analytics ────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Optional. When set, the Cloudflare Web Analytics beacon is injected into
# every page. When empty or unset, no tracking script is loaded.
# Get your token: dash.cloudflare.com → Analytics & Logs → Web Analytics
PUBLIC_CLOUDFLARE_WEB_ANALYTICS_TOKEN=

# ─── Google Search Console ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Optional. Set site.googleVerification in astro-paper.config.ts instead of
# using an environment variable — it is handled natively by the theme.
# See docs/GROWTH-SETUP.md for instructions.
